Ah, I can hear you! That sounds like a voice I recognize. What is this?

146
00:30:51,373 --> 00:30:54,573
1年ぶりのデスゲーム会場へようこそ！
Welcome to the death game venue for the first time in a year!

147
00:30:55,073 --> 00:30:56,573
これデスゲームか！
So this is a death game?!

148
00:30:58,073 --> 00:31:01,673
今からあなたには格付けに挑戦してもらいます。
From now on, you will be challenged to a ranking test.

