165
00:33:15,573 --> 00:33:21,573
え、違うのもしっかり？やばい！え、なんか両方とも、もうだめかもリリカ！じゃ、Cも。ん？C？
Wait, are they actually different? Oh no! Both of them... Ririka might be done for! Well, C then. Hm? C?

166
00:33:22,073 --> 00:33:36,073
C。し？は？あ。Cはなんか家でよく食べる味がする。待て、これ豚だわ！これ絶対豚！Cは豚だわ！ちょっともう一回AとB順番にお願いします！AとBを。
C. Shi? Ha? Ah. C tastes like what I usually eat at home. Wait, this is pork! This is definitely pork! C is pork! Hold on, please give me A and B in order again! A and B.

